sequenceDiagram
  participant Admin
  participant Landlord
  participant Backend
  participant Frontend

  Admin->>Landlord: ubah product + enabled features
  Landlord-->>Frontend: runtime config
  Frontend->>Backend: request feature data
  Backend->>Landlord: ambil runtime config saat perlu
  Landlord-->>Backend: productKey + enabledFeatures
  Backend-->>Frontend: data sesuai feature aktif
